{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "de65ff07-a514-8067-9b50-789a6302e201",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T14:09:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, but this is the number on the recording, so here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line's open. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The catch basin at the corner of my street is plugged solid. Leaves. Water backs right up into my driveway every time it rains. Thursday's soaker, it sat there for hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and what's the address you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty Chapel Street. Up on the Hill. The basin's down at the corner, maybe fifty feet from my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty Chapel, got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beverly Peckham."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Beverly. So the basin at the corner is clogged with leaves, water's pooling into your driveway. Has it been like that a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weeks. The leaves come down in November and nobody comes by. Every fall, same thing. That's the way it goes, I guess, but it doesn't have to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Is the water getting into the house or just the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Driveway and the walk. Not in the house. But my neighbor next door, she's up in her eighties, she can't get out. Her steps are right at the low spot. She won't walk through that water, and she shouldn't, she'll slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no good. So she's basically stuck inside when it's like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday and part of Friday, yeah. I brought her groceries over. I'm not young myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me put that in the notes, that there's an older resident on the street who can't get out when it backs up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put it in big letters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, typing. Catch basin clogged with leaves, corner by Chapel, water backing into driveway at thirty, elderly neighbor affected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Now, are you opening a work order? And what date? I don't want a maybe. I want a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order tonight, it goes in the queue first thing tomorrow. The date I can't give you for sure, since I don't schedule the crews. Usually the drains get cleared in the order they come in, and they've got a pile after Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So no date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you one from here, no. What I can do is note that you want a call back with a date. Is this the best number, the one you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-eight. Got it. I'll flag it for a callback from the supervisor's desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll tell you, I was gonna call earlier. I was watching my program and the remote batteries died halfway through. Had to get up, dig around for new ones, and I figured while I'm up I'll make the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, glad the batteries did something useful. Did you want me to put anything else on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that it's the leaves. Somebody comes with a shovel and a rake, it's fixed in ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll write that exactly. Crew should clear the leaves off the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if it rains again before they come, I'm calling back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Call this line anytime. I'll give you the ticket as filed tonight, Beverly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:09:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care, stay dry."
    }
  ],
